import Image from"next/image";import Link from"next/link";import{Container}from"@/components/ui/container";import type{SkillTraining,SkilledWork}from"../types/skilled-services.types";import{trainingStatus,workStatus}from"../utils/skilled-services.utils";
function List({title,items}:{title:string;items:string[]}){return <section className="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h2 className="text-xl font-black text-[#1B519F]">{title}</h2><ul className="mt-4 space-y-3">{items.map(x=><li key={x} className="flex gap-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600"><span className="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#1B519F]"/>{x}</li>)}</ul></section>}
export function TrainingDetails({item,relatedWork}:{item:SkillTraining;relatedWork?:SkilledWork}){const status=trainingStatus[item.status];const facts=[["Category",item.category],["Level",item.level],["Duration",item.duration],["Mode",item.mode],["Location",item.location]];return <DetailsShell backHref="/opportunities/skilled-services#learn-skills" backLabel="Back to Skills" title={item.title} subtitle={item.category} image={item.image} alt={`${item.title} practical training`} facts={facts} status={status} applyHref={`/opportunities/skilled-services/learn/${item.slug}/apply`} summaryTitle="Training Summary"><section className="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h2 className="text-xl font-black text-[#1B519F]">Skill Overview</h2><p className="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">{item.overview}</p><DemoNotice/></section><List title="What You Will Learn" items={item.learningOutcomes}/><List title="Practical Modules" items={item.modules}/><Chips title="Skills You Will Gain" items={item.skills}/><section className="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h2 className="text-xl font-black text-[#1B519F]">Who Should Join</h2><p className="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-600">{item.audience}</p></section><List title="Requirements" items={item.requirements}/><Info title="Training Information" text={`This ${item.duration.toLowerCase()} program is delivered in ${item.mode.toLowerCase()} mode${item.location?` in ${item.location}`:""}. Exact schedules have not been supplied.`}/><Info title="Application Information" text="Applications are submitted securely to Smartera Hub for review."/>{relatedWork?<Related href={`/opportunities/skilled-services/work/${relatedWork.slug}`} label={`Explore related work: ${relatedWork.title}`}/>:null}</DetailsShell>}
export function WorkDetails({item,relatedTraining}:{item:SkilledWork;relatedTraining?:SkillTraining}){const status=workStatus[item.status];const facts=[["Company",item.companyName],["Category",item.category],["Location",item.location],["Type",item.employmentType],["Work Mode",item.workMode],["Experience",item.experience]];return <DetailsShell backHref="/opportunities/skilled-services#skilled-work" backLabel="Back to Skilled Work" title={item.title} subtitle={item.companyName} image={item.image} alt={`${item.title} skilled-work opportunity`} facts={facts} status={status} applyHref={`/opportunities/skilled-services/work/${item.slug}/apply`} summaryTitle="Job Summary"><section className="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h2 className="text-xl font-black text-[#1B519F]">Role Overview</h2><p className="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">{item.shortDescription}</p><DemoNotice/></section><List title="Responsibilities" items={item.responsibilities}/><List title="Requirements" items={item.requirements}/><Chips title="Skills" items={item.skills}/><Info title="Experience" text={`This development fixture specifies ${item.experience} of relevant experience.`}/><Info title="About the Employer" text={`${item.companyName} is a fictional organization used only for interface development. It is not verified and no partnership is implied.`}/><Info title="Application Information" text="Applications and uploaded documents are submitted securely to Smartera Hub for review."/>{relatedTraining?<Related href={`/opportunities/skilled-services/learn/${relatedTraining.slug}`} label={`Build related skills: ${relatedTraining.title}`}/>:null}</DetailsShell>}
function DetailsShell({children,backHref,backLabel,title,subtitle,image,alt,facts,status,applyHref,summaryTitle}:{children:React.ReactNode;backHref:string;backLabel:string;title:string;subtitle:string;image:string;alt:string;facts:(string|undefined)[][];status:{label:string;canApply:boolean};applyHref:string;summaryTitle:string}){return <><section className="bg-[#F5F9FF] py-8"><Container><div className="flex gap-4 text-xs font-black text-[#1B519F]"><Link href={backHref}>{backLabel}</Link><Link href="/opportunities/skilled-services">Skilled Services</Link></div><div className="mt-5 grid overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr]"><div className="relative min-h-48"><Image src={image} alt={alt} fill sizes="220px" className="object-cover"/></div><div className="p-6"><span className="rounded-full bg-[#FFF3DF] px-2 py-1 text-[9px] font-black uppercase text-[#F59223]">Demo</span><h1 className="mt-3 text-3xl font-black text-[#1B519F]">{title}</h1><p className="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-500">{subtitle}</p><span className="mt-4 inline-block rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-black text-emerald-700">{status.label}</span></div></div></Container></section><section className="bg-[#FBFDFF] py-10"><Container className="grid items-start gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_310px]"><main className="space-y-5">{children}</main><aside className="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white lg:sticky lg:top-28"><h2 className="rounded-t-2xl bg-[#1B519F] p-5 text-lg font-black text-white">{summaryTitle}</h2><dl className="divide-y divide-slate-100 p-5">{facts.filter((x):x is string[]=>Boolean(x[1])).map(([a,b])=><div key={a} className="flex justify-between gap-3 py-3 text-xs"><dt className="text-slate-500">{a}</dt><dd className="text-right font-black text-[#1B519F]">{b}</dd></div>)}</dl><div className="px-5 pb-5">{status.canApply?<Link href={applyHref} className="flex h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#1B519F] text-sm font-black text-white">Apply Now</Link>:<p className="rounded-xl bg-slate-100 p-3 text-center text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">{status.label}</p>}<Link href={backHref} className="mt-3 flex justify-center text-xs font-bold text-[#1B519F]">Back to listings</Link></div></aside></Container></section></>}
function DemoNotice(){return <p className="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-[#FFF9EF] p-3 text-xs text-[#F59223]">This is a fictional development fixture, not a live program or vacancy.</p>}function Chips({title,items}:{title:string;items:string[]}){return <section className="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h2 className="text-xl font-black text-[#1B519F]">{title}</h2><div className="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">{items.map(x=><span key={x} className="rounded-full bg-[#EEF5FF] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-[#1B519F]">{x}</span>)}</div></section>}function Info({title,text}:{title:string;text:string}){return <section className="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h2 className="text-xl font-black text-[#1B519F]">{title}</h2><p className="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">{text}</p></section>}function Related({href,label}:{href:string;label:string}){return <Link href={href} className="block rounded-2xl border border-[#1B519F]/20 bg-[#EEF5FF] p-5 text-sm font-black text-[#1B519F]">{label} →</Link>}

